The bare run is flag-shaped and stays literal: a ---(p) b.\n -> text.carve
\n -> text.carve
The braced form converts wherever it stands: a  -> text.carve
{--} -> text.carve constant.character.entity.typography.carve
(p) b, x -> text.carve
{--} -> text.carve constant.character.entity.typography.carve
y,  -> text.carve
{--} -> text.carve constant.character.entity.typography.carve
start.\n -> text.carve
